# Mobile-First UI Contract (Main App)

Applies only to `app/app/[tenantId]/*`. Source of truth: `docs/ui-contract.md`.

## MUST
- Design mobile-first and support **360px** width.
- Use **bottom navigation** for Main App.
- Ensure tap targets are **>= 44px**.
- Use cards/lists/stacked sections.
- Each page has **1 primary purpose** and **<= 1 primary action**.

## MUST NOT
- Do NOT use tables.
- Do NOT add sidebars/complex menus in Main App.
- Do NOT introduce mouse/keyboard assumptions.
- Do NOT add large modals; prefer full-screen dialog/sheet patterns.
- Do NOT add native-only APIs yet (must remain web/PWA friendly).

## Route contract for bottom tabs (no changes now)
- Dashboard: OWNER/MANAGER -> `/app/[tenantId]/manager/home`, WORKER -> `/app/[tenantId]/worker/home`
- Team/Shifts/Receipts/Settings: use role-scoped routes under `/manager/*` and `/worker/*`

